WEBVTT

00:16:27.354 --> 00:16:33.238
učenje i posao i avantura i prijateljstva
- o, prijateljstva -

00:16:33.238 --> 00:16:37.007
i zajednica i ljubav.

00:16:37.007 --> 00:16:39.766
Ali pre svega, želeo sam da mu kažem

00:16:39.766 --> 00:16:42.135
ono što je Herman Melvil napisao:

00:16:42.135 --> 00:16:45.062
"Da bismo istinski uživali u toploti tela,

00:16:45.062 --> 00:16:48.119
mali deo nas mora biti hladan,

00:16:48.119 --> 00:16:50.422
jer ne postoji ni jedna stvar
na ovome svetu

00:16:50.422 --> 00:16:53.714
koja je ono što jeste
bez njene suprotnosti."

00:16:53.714 --> 00:16:56.155
Da, suprotnosti.

00:16:56.155 --> 00:16:58.494
Ako ste svesni onoga što nemate,

00:16:58.494 --> 00:17:01.722
možete zaista biti svesni
onoga što imate